of emoji, and CI is currently failing.\n\nDuplicates: #38090 and #54057 implement essentially the same change.\n\nSuggested consolidation: merge #38090 \u2014 the production diff is effectively identical in both PRs, but #38090 has green CI, is linked to this issue via `closes`, and its emoji regression test matches the exact symptom reported here; #54057 adds no substantive value beyond it and has red CI, so it could be closed as a duplicate. The only remaining open point is a deviation from the issue's proposed fix (no `InputEncoding`/`$OutputEncoding` setup), which appears unnecessary for the read path since only stdout is decoded.\n\n_Cross-PR triage: each diff was read against this issue; verdicts reflect diff content, not PR titles. Part of an automated triage batch._", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/5015452492/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/5227777645", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38077#issuecomment-5227777645", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38077", "id": 5227777645, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABN5mObQ", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "s